(3286, 12, 104, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Care Multi Speciality Hospital (Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY Empanelled)', 'केयर मल्टी स्पेशलिटी हॉस्पिटल (आयुष्मान भारत)', 'care-multi-speciality-hospital-hosp10p25123129', 'Hospital Administrator / Ayushman Nodal Officer', '7543032791', 'PUBLIC', NULL, NULL, 'PUBLIC', 'https://hem.nha.gov.in/', 'North Of Bharat Milap Chowk, Near J.P X-Ray, Bhagwan Bazar, Chapra, Saran, Saran, Bihar', '841301', 'https://maps.google.com/?q=Care+Multi+Speciality+Hospital+North+Of+Bharat+Milap+Chowk%2C+Near+J.P+X-Ray%2C+Bhagwan+Bazar%2C+Chapra%2C+Saran+Saran+Bihar', '24x7 Emergency & Inpatient Services | OPD: 8:00 AM - 2:00 PM & 4:00 PM - 8:00 PM', 'Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY Cashless Hospitalization (Up to Rs 5 Lakh/Year per Family), 24x7 Emergency Casualty & Trauma Care, In-Patient Department (IPD), Out-Patient Department (OPD), Ayushman Arogya Mitra (PMAM) Verification & Pre-Auth Desk, Laparoscopic & Polytrauma Surgery (दूरबीन व ट्रॉमा सर्जरी), Diagnostic Pathology & Digital X-Ray, Post-Operative Monitoring, Free Medication & Diagnostics for PM-JAY Beneficiaries', 'Ayushman Mitra Registration Counter, Major & Minor Operation Theatres (OT), Intensive Care Unit (ICU / HDU), Emergency & Triage Beds, In-house Pharmacy, Pathology & Diagnostic Imaging Lab, 24x7 Ambulance Service (102/108), Free Dietary & Nursing Care for Inpatients', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'HOSP10P25123129', 'Official Pradhan Mantri Jan Arogya Yojana (AB-PMJAY / Ayushman Bharat) Empanelled Private Hospital in Saran District, Bihar.\n\n🏥 Facility Overview:\n• Facility Name: Care Multi Speciality Hospital\n• NHA Facility ID: HOSP10P25123129\n• Sector: Private Healthcare Facility\n• Facility Type: Hospital\n• Address: North Of Bharat Milap Chowk, Near J.P X-Ray, Bhagwan Bazar, Chapra, Saran, Saran, Bihar\n• Contact Number: 7543032791 | PM-JAY National Helpline: 14555\n• Date of Establishment: 20-03-2025\n• PM-JAY Empanelment Date: 22-10-2025\n\n🩺 Empanelled Clinical & Surgical Specialities:\nLaparoscopic & Polytrauma Surgery (दूरबीन व ट्रॉमा सर्जरी)\n\n💳 Ayushman Bharat (PM-JAY) Benefits & How to Avail Cashless Treatment:\n1. Beneficiaries with Ayushman Golden Card / Ration Card / PM-JAY letter can receive up to ₹5,00,000 per family per year in 100% free cashless inpatient treatments.\n2. Visit the Pradhan Mantri Arogya Mitra (PMAM) helpdesk at the hospital entrance with your Aadhaar Card and Ration Card / Ayushman Card.\n3. Hospitalization, diagnostic tests, surgeries, medicines during stay, and post-discharge medications are completely covered under Government of India & State Health Agency (SHA) Bihar norms.\n\n🇮🇳 आयुष्मान भारत योजना (PM-JAY) की जानकारी:\nयह अस्पताल राष्ट्रीय स्वास्थ्य प्राधिकरण (NHA) द्वारा आयुष्मान भारत - प्रधानमंत्री जन आरोग्य योजना के तहत पंजीकृत है। योग्य परिवार प्रति वर्ष ₹5 लाख तक का निःशुल्क कैशलेस उपचार प्राप्त कर सकते हैं। अस्पताल के आयुष्मान मित्र काउंटर पर अपना आधार कार्ड व राशन कार्ड दिखाकर तुरंत भर्ती सुविधा प्राप्त करें।', NULL, 'YES', 'NO', 'ACTIVE', 'FREE', NULL, 2, 5.00, '2026-09-12 18:54:02', '2026-09-12 19:08:04', 'hem.nha.gov.in', 0),
